# List of source files containing translatable strings.
# Please keep this file sorted alphabetically.
#
# Upstream also lists data/io.github.wartybix.Constrict.desktop.in,
# .metainfo.xml.in and .gschema.xml.in here. This port has no desktop entry,
# no AppStream metainfo and no GSettings schema — its settings live in a JSON
# file — so the strings those three contributed are present in the .po files
# but have no source file to extract from here.
